# SquarePass™ (Platform Build Spec #009)

Dynamic promotion & referral engine — **admin-configured campaigns**, no hardcoded promo logic in app code.

## Rules

- Route all promo/referral data through `SquarePassEngine` — not direct Supabase in UI
- Frame rewards as **exclusive opportunities**, never discounts
- Campaign rewards are JSON in `square_pass_campaigns.rewards`
- Fraud checks via `FraudGuardService` before every redemption
- Signup bonuses are idempotent via `square_pass_redemptions` audit rows

## New Competitor Automated Experience™

- Every new competitor enters the welcome flow automatically after first dashboard login
- Wire dashboard via `SquarePassAutomationProvider` inside `GenesisProvider`
- Route automation through `AutomationEngine` — not direct Supabase in UI
- Mystery SquarePass **always grants a reward** — weighted pool from `square_pass_mystery_pool`
- No manual promo code entry for welcome/mystery/daily flows
- Backwards compat: accounts >48h old skip onboarding modals on state init
- Founder limit: `FOUNDING_COMPETITOR_LIMIT` env (default 10000)

## Adding a campaign type

1. Add type to migration check constraint if new enum value needed
2. Extend `SquarePassRewardType` in `types.ts`
3. Handle in `RewardDistributionService.distributeRewards`
4. Seed template in migration only — activate via admin

## API

Player routes require authenticated session via `getSquarePassAuthorizedEmail()`.  
Admin routes require `getAuthorizedAdminUser()` or `requireCommandCenterAdmin("analytics")`.

Full spec: `docs/project-legacy/SQUARE_PASS.md`
